factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The reel_script states the driver is 46 years old and from Bhalkot-like wording 'பாகல்கோட்டையைச் சேர்ந்த 46 வயது டிரைவர்' — the article gives the name 'டாங்கிரி, 46' and origin Bagalkot, so age is supported; however the caption and reel_script attribute the place 'Bagalkot' correctly, so no error here.
  The reel_script says the driver 'காயமடைந்தார்' is accurate, but it omits the driver's name (டாங்கிரி), which is an important identifying fact of the article.
  The slide 'எப்படி நடந்தது?' line 'டிரைவர் தூக்க கலக்கத்தில் லாரியின் கட்டுப்பாட்டை இழந்தார்' is fine, but the slide line 'இரு முறை இரும்பு சங்கிலி உடைந்ததால் தாமதம்; 4 மணி' is truncated and ungrammatical/unclear in Tamil.
  The slides_spec line 'தாவனகரேயிலிருந்து கொச்சிக்கு கொண்டு' is an incomplete sentence split across lines, lacking a clear meaning without the next line.
  The caption's first line 'பொள்ளாச்சி சாலைக்கு அருகே' places the accident near Pollachi road, while the article says the lorry was heading toward the Pollachi road junction and crashed near Chettipalayam JJ Nagar bridge; this is a mixing of location details.
  The caption's second paragraph states the accident occurred at 'செட்டிபாளையம், ஜெ.ஜெ.நகர் பாலம் அருகே' while the first paragraph gives the road location, mixing two locations into one sentence.
  The reel_script says the driver was 'தூக்க கலக்கத்தில் இருந்ததால்' stated as cause, which is supported by the article, but the reel_script's headline/caption attribute the crash to the driver's sleepiness as established fact rather than as the outcome of investigation; this is consistent with the article's 'விசாரணையில் தெரிந்தது', so no error.
